        <mxCell id="34" value="The step-4 and step-5 reasoning can no longer both be produced. At step 5 the &lt;font face='Courier New'&gt;[REVISIT]&lt;/font&gt; flag on &lt;font face='Courier New'&gt;T04&lt;/font&gt; makes the backward move visibly a repeat, so &quot;proceeds forward&quot; and &quot;proceeds directly&quot; resolve to the same direction.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The model still reasons locally. &lt;b&gt;Local now includes the past.&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#82B366;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=14;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=12;fontSize=15;fontColor=#37474F;" vertex="1" parent="1">
